1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,338
Our teeth sit in bony sockets, come in two sets, and are of four kinds: incisors cut, canines tear, premolars and molars grind.

2
00:00:10,338 --> 00:00:15,078
The dental formula counts one half of each jaw, so it is doubled.

3
00:00:15,078 --> 00:00:22,291
Two incisors, one canine, two premolars, three molars, above and below: thirty two.

4
00:00:22,291 --> 00:00:25,468
Milk teeth have no premolars: twenty.

